			<h1>Owner Operated Professional Licensed Tree Care</h1>
			<p>
				ISA Certified Arborist serving homeowners across Southern Maine. Professional tree care focused on safety, health, and long-term preservation of Maine's trees.  
Owner-operated, insured, professional tree care.
			</p>

<div class="badges">
ISA Certified Arboriist • TRAQ Tree Risk Assessment Qualified • Fully Insured • Owner Operated 
 </div>
<h2>Tree Care Services</h2>
<h3>Tree Pruning</h3>
      <p>Improve structure, safety, and long-term tree health.</p>
 <h3>Tree Removal</h3>
      <p>Safe removal of hazardous or unwanted trees.</p>

 <h3>Tree Risk Assessment</h3>
      <p>TRAQ-certified evaluations for hazardous trees.</p>
 <h3>Storm Cleanup</h3>
      <p>Emergency response after wind or storm damage.</p>

 <h3>Tree Preservation</h3>
      <p>Focus on saving and improving valuable trees when possible.</p>
